Whenever you redistribute the Software or any copyright-protected portion
of it under this license, in source or compiled form, you must:

a. Retain existing copyright, authorship, and license notices applicable to
   that material and provide a complete copy of this license with it.
   Preserve any applicable third-party notices as well.

b. If you redistribute a modified version, prominently state that it is
   unofficial and not an official CraftableMC release, and provide a brief,
   accurate description of the changes. Include these statements with the
   distributed copy in a readily accessible notice or equivalent location,
   and in its project or download description where one exists. You may add
   accurate credit for your own work without replacing existing attribution.

c. Not misrepresent the Software's origin or claim that your modifications,
   project, server, or services are produced, endorsed, or supported by
   CraftableMC without its permission.

No general trademark or branding license is granted. Truthful attribution,
identification of compatibility, and redistribution of the unmodified
Software with its existing notices and branding are allowed, but must not
imply endorsement. Technical identifiers needed for compatibility may remain
unchanged in modified versions; that does not waive the unofficial-version
and change-notice requirements. No in-game watermark is required.

Recipients obtain permissions for the Licensor's material directly under
this license. You must not remove these conditions from that material or
purport to grant broader rights in it than you hold. Your independently
owned contributions and separate works are not automatically relicensed
by this provision.

